                                                "sense_id": "2e5a7bf0-58f2-3d0b-b05f-a7cfb8431636",
                                                "text": "Although many believe HTLV-III plays a primary role in the development of AIDS, it is still unresolved how the virus works and what cofactors, if any, play a role."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08644c71-42c5-3acd-8a94-75d3f96b50d0",
